{"id": "195f5fa5-93b3-4830-874a-4b0e170aa374", "slug": "global-network-2", "title": "Global Network", "description": "Global Network Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Global Network\"\ndescription: \"Global Network Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00E5FF\"\n  secondary: \"#111111\"\n  accent: \"#00E5FF\"\n  background: \"#111111\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Global Network\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 20; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: button, animated, cta, action, effect.\n## Overview\nGlobal Network Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nBuild faster, scale infinitely. Whenever you push code to your repository, we make it instantly available across the network. Explore Platform Contact Sales deployed\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Build faster, scale infinitely. Whenever you push code to your repository, we make it instantly available across the network..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00E5FF, secondary #111111, accent #00E5FF, background #111111, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Global Network</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #0a0a0a;\n            background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 25vw 100%;\n            background-position: center top;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); }\n            50% { transform: translateY(-6px) translateX(2px); }\n        }\n\n        .animate-float-1 { animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite; }\n        .animate-float-2 { animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite 1s; }\n        .animate-float-3 { animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite 2s; }\n        .animate-float-4 { animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite 0.5s; }\n        .animate-float-5 { animation: float 6.5s ease-in-out infinite 1.5s; }\n\n        iconify-icon {\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: -0.125em;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center pt-24 md:pt-32 overflow-x-hidden relative\">\n\n    <!-- Header Section -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-3xl px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight mb-8\">\n            Build faster, <span class=\"text-slate-400\">scale infinitely.</span><br class=\"hidden md:block\">\n            <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg md:text-2xl font-normal tracking-normal mt-2 block\">\n                Whenever you push code to your repository, we<br class=\"hidden md:block\"> make it instantly available across the network.\n            </span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-2\">\n            <button class=\"bg-white text-black px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-[#0a0a0a] focus:ring-white\">\n                Explore Platform\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"bg-transparent text-white border border-white/10 shadow-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-[#0a0a0a] focus:ring-white/20\">\n                Contact Sales\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Interactive Graphic Section -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] h-[500px] md:h-[600px] mt-16 md:mt-24 flex justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Canvas for drawing the 3D-like grid and glowing animations -->\n        <canvas id=\"globeCanvas\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Overlay Nodes (Positioned absolutely over the canvas relative to parent) -->\n\n        <!-- Node 1: Top Left -->\n        <div id=\"node-1\" class=\"absolute top-[25%] left-[30%] md:left-[35%] bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm z-10 animate-float-1\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Node 2: Middle Right -->\n        <div id=\"node-2\" class=\"absolute top-[50%] right-[30%] md:right-[35%] bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm z-10 animate-float-2\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Node 3: Bottom Left -->\n        <div id=\"node-3\" class=\"absolute top-[75%] left-[20%] md:left-[25%] bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm z-10 animate-float-3\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cloud-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Node 4: Center Lower -->\n        <div id=\"node-4\" class=\"absolute top-[65%] left-[45%] md:left-[42%] bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm z-10 animate-float-4\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Node 5: Bottom Right -->\n        <div id=\"node-5\" class=\"absolute top-[65%] right-[20%] md:right-[22%] bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm z-10 animate-float-5\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Status Badge -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#111]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-lg py-1.5 px-3 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm z-20\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono tracking-tight\">deployed</span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:restart-linear\" class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('globeCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        let width, height, cx, cy;\n\n        const glowingPaths = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n            width = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n            height = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n\n            canvas.width = width * dpr;\n            canvas.height = height * dpr;\n\n            ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n            canvas.style.width = `${width}px`;\n            canvas.style.height = `${height}px`;\n\n            cx = width / 2;\n            cy = 80;\n\n            initPaths();\n        }\n\n        function drawGrid() {\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n            const latCount = 6;\n            for (let i = 1; i <= latCount; i++) {\n                const progress = i / latCount;\n                const currentY = cy + (height - cy) * progress * 0.9;\n                const radiusX = width * 0.45 * Math.sin(progress * Math.PI / 2);\n                const radiusY = 100 * progress;\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                if (ctx.ellipse) {\n                    ctx.ellipse(cx, currentY, radiusX, radiusY, 0, Math.PI, 0, true);\n                } else {\n                    ctx.arc(cx, currentY, radiusX, Math.PI, 0, true);\n                }\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n\n            const longCount = 13;\n            for (let i = 0; i < longCount; i++) {\n                const progress = i / (longCount - 1);\n                const targetX = cx + (width * 0.9) * (progress - 0.5);\n                const targetY = height;\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(cx, cy);\n                const cpY = cy + (height - cy) * 0.4;\n                const cpX = cx + (targetX - cx) * 0.8;\n\n                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(cpX, cpY, targetX, targetY);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initPaths() {\n            glowingPaths.length = 0;\n            const nodeIds = ['node-1', 'node-2', 'node-3', 'node-4', 'node-5'];\n\n            nodeIds.forEach((id, index) => {\n                const node = document.getElementById(id);\n                if (!node) return;\n                glowingPaths.push({\n                    x0: cx, y0: cy,\n                    node: node,\n                    progress: index * 0.2,\n                    speed: 0.002 + (Math.random() * 0.001),\n                    color: '#00e5ff'\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        function getQuadraticBezierPoint(t, p0, cp, p1) {\n            const u = 1 - t;\n            const tt = t * t;\n            const uu = u * u;\n            const p = {\n                x: uu * p0.x + 2 * u * t * cp.x + tt * p1.x,\n                y: uu * p0.y + 2 * u * t * cp.y + tt * p1.y\n            };\n            return p;\n        }\n\n        function drawGlows() {\n            const parentRect = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            glowingPaths.forEach(path => {\n                path.progress += path.speed;\n                if (path.progress > 1.2) path.progress = -0.2;\n\n                if (path.progress < 0 || path.progress > 1) return;\n\n                // Dynamically look up the current position of the floating node\n                const rect = path.node.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const targetX = rect.left - parentRect.left + rect.width / 2;\n                const targetY = rect.top - parentRect.top + rect.height / 2;\n\n                // Adjust control points so it bends along the globe grid\n                const cpx = cx + (targetX - cx) * 0.8;\n                const cpy = cy + (targetY - cy) * 0.4;\n\n                ctx.save();\n                ctx.beginPath();\n\n                const trailLength = 0.25;\n                const startT = Math.max(0, path.progress - trailLength);\n                const endT = Math.min(1, path.progress);\n\n                const steps = 15;\n                for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\n                    const t = startT + (endT - startT) * (i / steps);\n                    const pt = getQuadraticBezierPoint(t, {x: path.x0, y: path.y0}, {x: cpx, y: cpy}, {x: targetX, y: targetY});\n                    if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(pt.x, pt.y);\n                    else ctx.lineTo(pt.x, pt.y);\n                }\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = path.color;\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.shadowColor = path.color;\n                ctx.shadowBlur = 12;\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                ctx.strokeStyle = '#ffffff';\n                ctx.shadowBlur = 0;\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                ctx.restore();\n            });\n        }\n\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            drawGrid();\n            drawGlows();\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n        animate();\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "global-network-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/global-network-2.jpg", "source_name": "global-network-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 74, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:37:43.227637+00:00"}